{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/lerobot/pulls/4454","id":4281985148,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLKB0uM7_Oeh8","html_url":"https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot/pull/4454","diff_url":"https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot/pull/4454.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot/pull/4454.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/lerobot/issues/4454","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/lerobot/pulls/4454/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/lerobot/pulls/4454/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/lerobot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/lerobot/issues/4454/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/lerobot/statuses/c743a6fc4a2dabbdf87d331fe3d2ac40caf6e6e8","number":4454,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(rtc): chunk-splice jump and mean-action seam","user":{"login":"Maximellerbach","id":38923282,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4OTIzMjgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38923282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maximellerbach","html_url":"https://github.com/Maximellerbach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maximellerbach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maximellerbach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maximellerbach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maximellerbach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maximellerbach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maximellerbach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maximellerbach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maximellerbach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maximellerbach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> Stacked on #4452. The three non-ordering RTC fixes from #4122.\n\n**Chunk-splice jump.** `_check_and_resolve_delays` discarded `real_delay` actions even when the robot consumed fewer during inference (`indexes_diff` is 0 on the first chunk, or whenever the queue starved). That splices the queue ahead of the physical pose and the arm executes it as a jump. Now clamped to `min(real_delay, indexes_diff)`.\n\n**Mean-action seam.** `_normalize_prev_actions_length` zero-padded the RTC prefix. Those indices fall inside the guided region, and a zero in normalized action space decodes to the dataset *mean* — pulling the spliced action toward a neutral pose for one step (`95 → 103 → 95`). Now holds the last real action; empty prefix raises instead of inventing one.\n\n**Cold-start latency.** The first inference is always slow and was fed into the `p95` sizing `inference_delay` unless `torch.compile` was on. Now always excluded.\n\nTests cover each fix, and `test_typical_rtc_workflow` / `test_merge_validates_delay_consistency` are updated — they encoded the old unclamped behaviour.\n\n```\npytest tests/policies/rtc tests/test_rollout.py tests/test_rollout_action_ordering.py \\\n       tests/test_interactive_rollout.py tests/policies/test_relative_actions.py\n# 364 passed\n```\n","labels":[{"id":6829375825,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLKB0uM8AAAABlxABUQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/lerobot/labels/policies","name":"policies","description":"Items related to robot policies","color":"6a737d","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6829388968,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLKB0uM8AAAABlxA0qA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/lerobot/labels/tests","name":"tests","description":"Problems with test coverage, failures, or improvements to testing","color":"8dc149","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-14T17:39:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T10:19:47Z","closed_at":"2026-09-22T10:19:4